<title>USA: Employee Solutions awarded contract.</title>
<headline>Employee Solutions awarded contract.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Employee Solutions Inc said Friday it signed an agreement to provide drivers and support personnel to the Worldwide Dedicated Services Inc unit of United Parcel Service of America Inc.</p>
<p>Employee will implement a customized program for Worldwide through its Logistics Personnel Corp unit, formerly called Leaseway Personnel.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Shares of Employee Solutions were unchanged at 16-1/4 in early afternoon trading on Nasdaq.</p>
</text>
